      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In my opinion this should actually stay the way it is.\nAs a very privacy conscious person I strongly believe that a status should only be visible to people you are in proximity of, or have added as a friend.\nAnything you want to show to everyone should be in the bio.\nMaybe I want my friends to know what in playing, or that I'm sleeping, or pissed off, but not the entire player base of the game.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
